// KPI baseline snapshot for regression checks

EVALUATE
ROW (
    "Total Revenue", [Total Revenue],
    "Total Profit", [Total Profit],
    "Total Customers", [Total Customers],
    "Total Orders", [Total Orders],
    "AOV", [Avg Order Value],
    "Profit Margin %", [Profit Margin %],
    "Margin ratio 4dp", FORMAT ( [Profit Margin %], "0.0000" ),
    "Margin percent", FORMAT ( [Profit Margin %], "0.00%" )
)Dobra, działa. Zostawimy w tej formie na razie i jedziemy dalej. s